# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# The client is a React Router app (client/src/App.jsx has 9 routes: /search,
# /library, /liked, /playlist/:id, /album/:source/:id, /artist/:source/:id, ...).
# Without this, a hard refresh or a shared link to anything but "/" returns
# Pages' 404, because only index.html exists on disk.
#
# Real files (assets/*, sw.js, manifest.json, icons/*) are served before any
# rewrite is considered, so the catch-all only ever catches unknown paths.
/* /index.html 200
